<p>By signing up for Tamirhane or opening a demo shop you accept these terms.</p>

<h2>The service</h2>
<p>Tamirhane is a free work order tracking app for repair shops: device intake, quotes and customer approval, parts stock, payment records, warranty and a customer tracking page. Its source code is open under the AGPL-3.0 licence. The service is free; there are no ads and no paid plans.</p>

<h2>Your account</h2>
<ul>
    <li>You must give accurate details when signing up and verify your email address.</li>
    <li>Keeping your password safe and giving your staff only the role they need is your responsibility. Actions taken in your account belong to your shop.</li>
    <li>You can delete your shop from Settings at any time; deleted data cannot be recovered.</li>
</ul>

<h2>The shop's responsibilities</h2>
<ul>
    <li>You are the data controller for the customers you record. Reading the privacy notice to the customer at intake and getting their consent is your duty; the app does not save a new customer without recording that consent.</li>
    <li>Prices, quotes, payments and warranty records are information you enter. Tamirhane does not collect money or issue invoices; your official accounting and invoicing obligations still apply.</li>
    <li>Emails and notifications to customers are sent in your shop's name; you are responsible for their content.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Prohibited use</h2>
<p>You may not use the service for anything illegal, to process other people's data without permission, to send spam, or to overload the system or try to break its security. In these cases the account may be closed without warning.</p>

<h2>No warranty</h2>
<p>The service is free and provided "as is": it is not guaranteed to run without interruption or errors, or that data will never be lost. Keeping your own copies of important records (receipts, payments) is recommended. To the extent the law allows, no liability is accepted for indirect damage arising from using or being unable to use the service.</p>

<h2>Demo shops</h2>
<p>Demo shops are a public trial: they open with sample data, send no email and are deleted with all their data after 24 hours. Do not enter real customer details in a demo.</p>

<h2>Changes and ending the service</h2>
<p>The service or these terms may change; the current version is on this page. If the service is ever shut down, shop owners are told by email in advance. These terms are governed by the law of the Republic of Türkiye.</p>

